<title>CHINA: China corn exports at 2.01 million T in Jan-June.</title>
<headline>China corn exports at 2.01 million T in Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's corn exports soared in the first half of this year compared with the same period last year to 2.01 million tonnes, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-JUNE	JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>    Corn   2.01 million	 920,000	+11,920.5</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-JUNE	JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>		 0		     N/A	  -99.9</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes</p>
<p>China's corn exports for the year-ago period were given as zero.</p>
<p>China halted corn exports in late 1994 amid soaring domestic prices.</p>
<p>China's corn imports were zero for the first six months compared with imports of 440,000 tonnes in the year-ago period, the customs figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
